  "edits": [
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00002",
      "source_hash": "1b59a25a5fa44bb88d41f4da7e6f1d2b44a05a5e1457ef06de845b2e2772574b",
      "target_id": "XML:2703136",
      "text": "个人信息保护负责人的资格（与第三十二条第四款相关）"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00003",
      "source_hash": "072670426e962629501f7b764ecce09529c8eeff79a45849c379a46397e4680a",
      "target_id": "XML:2703137",
      "text": "1. 依照第三十二条第四款指定为个人信息保护负责人的人员，应将个人信息保护经历、"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00004",
      "source_hash": "77d429b7bf40e3e7f1369cca4b2b9f83028e86d116b3d14fb676d1b9b9ab7c8b",
      "target_id": "XML:2703138",
      "text": "信息保护经历及信息技术经历合计具有四年以上，其中个人信息"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00005",
      "source_hash": "fbe16f894ceec80b68e6f4d5cef02a0a5229055594bce01a70ecc3a981a73fec",
      "target_id": "XML:2703139",
      "text": "保护经历须至少具有两年以上。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00006",
      "source_hash": "2b843a615fdfbf47718bba0c075f5eff293887208a4abc8f61cd09b256a53df9",
      "target_id": "XML:2703140",
      "text": "2. 第一号所称“个人信息保护经历”，是指在公共机构、企业、教育机构及研究机构等"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00007",
      "source_hash": "133daae89ea4fd70e00dfb0286420a2b060a34d223f428fc57fa2d4b55b324cd",
      "target_id": "XML:2703141",
      "text": "从事个人信息保护相关政策与制度、个人信息影响评估、个人信息保护"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00008",
      "source_hash": "fcfb4f77620537653e521a52e50c4b7408d8497a68b5044c8921b17894d33f27",
      "target_id": "XML:2703142",
      "text": "认证审查等个人信息保护业务的经历，以及个人信息保护相关咨询或"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00009",
      "source_hash": "8684814cd3965ccd1643c0a952a713cb62f3d3cc6dd8f895a83a9eb3e29d6100",
      "target_id": "XML:2703143",
      "text": "法律咨询经历。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00010",
      "source_hash": "9493f37d9d4fac81c2944b3ce9004041b215e1d82251864bf13ba425ca1b4fca",
      "target_id": "XML:2703144",
      "text": "3. 第一号所称“信息保护经历”，是指在公共机构、企业、教育机构及研究机构等"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00011",
      "source_hash": "627fc852ed421aaf542e343cb4503bcfc6231d0161166820059e9e58bbf19925",
      "target_id": "XML:2703145",
      "text": "从事信息保护共同基础技术、系统与网络保护、应用服务保护、"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00012",
      "source_hash": "89c171682f2fe8297ec48ab4a95a22b530d5c2a82ae1b0cfafe5399233b16a42",
      "target_id": "XML:2703146",
      "text": "规划、分析、设计、开发、运营、维护、咨询、监理或研究开发等"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00013",
      "source_hash": "f8f2fd135d07f0819039a74a08be7a6b2aad8da2e288332e225c2b824f6f0c10",
      "target_id": "XML:2703147",
      "text": "信息保护业务的经历，以及信息保护相关咨询或法律咨询经历。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00014",
      "source_hash": "3aa8600fe050d2d7285f1e363e8c7942aeca4acf9323b9535f9021e3ea25c45a",
      "target_id": "XML:2703148",
      "text": "4. 第一号所称“信息技术经历”，是指在公共机构、企业、教育机构及研究机构等"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00015",
      "source_hash": "86b1cb3c045b032438d9bb3f320e756b3e73a9481a27c8d0dd6ab2aaf0e7e857",
      "target_id": "XML:2703149",
      "text": "于信息通信服务、信息通信设备、软件及计算机相关服务领域"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00016",
      "source_hash": "0a17c469141c9efa4b025a024199e9b97ef33c282a53b1e8bb3e934f58997b3e",
      "target_id": "XML:2703150",
      "text": "从事规划、分析、设计、开发、运营、维护、咨询、监理或研究开发等"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00017",
      "source_hash": "f254c12ae7b243e5504826b1a7a1abf3b9c427c5a565d1bacfa3e7cb5552118f",
      "target_id": "XML:2703151",
      "text": "信息技术业务的经历，以及信息技术相关咨询或法律咨询经历"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37052-zh-00018",
      "source_hash": "581d7432d17a8bb1a9126a9b9d558f65ecda93a65fd3e5b340d55d650b003147",
      "target_id": "XML:2703152",
      "text": "。"
    }
  ],
  "note": "Annex A37052 1-18 Korean source cross-checked; title and experience definitions corrected using adjoining physical source lines; row 1 preserved. Annex remains partial."
}
